{"1285040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "D-Corp", "steam_appid": 1285040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1899330, 1937740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/4d823f73cc503822932e9023366b1425.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Arena Mode introduces PvP, player-versus-player gameplay into D-Corp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/a86f15d9fe8ee2a581e8f18ac8f44757.poster.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/a86f15d9fe8ee2a581e8f18ac8f44757.webm?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/a86f15d9fe8ee2a581e8f18ac8f44757.mp4?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/6291581190507a09b9e528e2e6e91d10.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D-Corp</strong> is a crazy couch co-op game for up to 4 players. Play as a team of cute, customizable robots. Fulfill the corporate dreams of your brainy boss. Work together on tasks such as turret maintenance and harvesting natural resources while being under continuous attack by alien cacti!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the dynamic gameplay in this light-hearted game about silly attempts at teamwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/8cae3a4309b5b89efb399d166abc53f5.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/4730755455ae45625c3314a740a974fe.poster.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/4730755455ae45625c3314a740a974fe.webm?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/4730755455ae45625c3314a740a974fe.mp4?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/eec96073a0f1c8bc4a961bcd4bba1844.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players through local play or via Steam Remote Play 👫🎮</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op campaign as well as a separate versus mode! 🆚</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop cacti aliens from overrunning your base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different defense plans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap all resources and carry them back to your recycler 🔨🤖</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your friend into deadly acid pool! 💚</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload, maintain and relocate a variety of turrets to protect your operation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, unlock, and wear dozens of shiny hats! 🎩</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fetch ammo in time before the turrets run out -- throw it if you have to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was designed to be played with <strong>gamepads.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/92d0a80bf4cfc1919341d0fb3c2f4614.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will love 💖 <strong>D-Corp</strong> if you enjoyed games like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Overcooked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unrailed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It Takes Two</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/9cd59af7407293cf548e708069feb961.poster.avif?t=1728910131\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/9cd59af7407293cf548e708069feb961.webm?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285040/extras/9cd59af7407293cf548e708069feb961.mp4?t=1728910131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret code is: SMELTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like what you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to receive D-Corp exclusive content and announcements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class